WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
On this day a hundred years ago

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.500
the Zeleni Venac market opened.

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.040
On this day, October 1, 1926,

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.260
the Zeleni Venac market opened in Belgrade,

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.700
one of the best-known and oldest city markets,

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.300
recognizable by its architecture

7
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.960
and its location in the very center of the capital.

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.200
For a whole century the market has been a place

9
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.820
where every day

10
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.580
merchants, producers and Belgraders met.

11
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.820
Over the decades Zeleni Venac has become much more than a market:

12
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.960
it's one of the symbols of old Belgrade

13
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.840
and a witness to the big changes the city has gone through.

14
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.040
Today Zeleni Venac is a transport hub

15
00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.780
and one of the main points

16
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.560
for everyone who uses public transport.

17
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.580
Thousands of Belgraders still pass through the market.